   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Also open: the verification method for 2.3, the 48h-vs-72h window, call-recording consent under Israeli law, and OXS endpoint docs — the table above says what the modules expose, not what the requests look like.",
